The Slaughter of the Old Hen.

777
00:51:13,969 --> 00:51:16,256
And we'll be doing a sacrificial dance alongside it.

778
00:51:17,083 --> 00:51:20,084
I'm not performing with them. I'd rather just watch.

779
00:51:20,792 --> 00:51:21,870
Then why don't you perform with me?

780
00:51:22,211 --> 00:51:24,867
I'm doing a magic show, and I need an assistant.

781
00:51:25,262 --> 00:51:29,880
So the assistant has to wear something revealing and hand you props, right?

782
00:51:30,051 --> 00:51:32,440
I've got just the figure for it, Veekit!

783
00:51:34,939 --> 00:51:37,067
Okay, I'll perform with you, Veekit.

784
00:52:01,190 --> 00:52:04,032
Jolene, watch my livestream during the performance.

785
00:52:04,379 --> 00:52:05,840
And when the big moment comes,

786
00:52:06,056 --> 00:52:07,920
quickly clip the video and take screenshots.

787
00:52:08,243 --> 00:52:10,480
Post them on every social media platform as fast as you can.

788
00:52:10,920 --> 00:52:13,840
This is going to be so much fun, Nopnapha will scream!

789
00:53:08,315 --> 00:53:09,316
Ten million baht.

790
00:53:10,640 --> 00:53:13,080
I hope that's enough to buy my husband back.

791
00:53:13,451 --> 00:53:16,760
The Director's skills in bed are worth far more than ten million.

792
00:53:17,600 --> 00:53:18,601
Keep your money.

793
00:53:19,560 --> 00:53:21,361
You might need it someday to pay a man to sleep with you.

794
00:53:22,454 --> 00:53:24,960
Someone go ask that damn mistress what happened to her.

795
00:53:25,254 --> 00:53:28,055
Everyone wants to know what happened to Ta, don't they?

796
00:53:28,097 --> 00:53:30,760
Why should I be the only one asking?

797
00:53:31,763 --> 00:53:33,560
Why do you have to pry into other people's business?

798
00:53:34,307 --> 00:53:36,000
Will knowing make your lives any better?

799
00:53:36,707 --> 00:53:37,920
But I know what happened.

800
00:53:39,448 --> 00:53:41,200
Come on, tell us a little!

801
00:53:45,176 --> 00:53:47,400
Call a hitman and have that bitch shot in the head right now!
